      "content": "REST surface for the Faros AI engineering-operations intelligence platform. Covers account/identity, graph management, event and data ingestion, inbound webhooks, and the GraphQL query endpoint over the Faros canonical model. All requests are authenticated with a Faros API key passed in the Authorization header. Endpoint paths are modeled from the public Faros documentation, faros-js-client, and faros-events-cli; verify against the Faros API reference for exact request/response schemas.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Faros AI Support\n Email: support@faros.ai",
